// P2 T4 -- Reflex 2 firings  [stat]
// Same source and same window convention as reflex 1's tile.
// Expect a small number: the 10 persisted terminal_compromise rows come from one
// episode retried with lookback_hours tuned to its own duration. That is
// documented in Gate_Check_Results.md, not a defect in this tile.
alerts_v2
| where reflex_type == 'terminal_compromise'
| where window_start between (_startTime .. _endTime)
| summarize Value = count()
